            <title>[IGNITE-12799] Set right SpEL at Spring Data tests</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12799</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;PersonExpressionRepository uses&#160; SpEL &quot;@cacheNames.personCacheName&quot;. It is wrong. SpEL &quot;#{cacheNames.personCacheName}&quot; must be used.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
